    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "text": "九年级化学 根据化学方程式的计算",
      "role": "title",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          138,
          1150,
          201
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "MAIN_CONTENT",
        "relation": "main",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stem1",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "16．实验室用氯酸钾（"
        },
        {
          "type": "chemistry",
          "latex": "\\mathrm{KClO_3}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "）和二氧化锰（"
        },
        {
          "type": "chemistry",
          "latex": "\\mathrm{MnO_2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "）的混合物加热制取氧气。"
        }
      ],
      "role": "stem",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          201,
          1150,
          264
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "MAIN_CONTENT",
        "relation": "main",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "（1）写出该反应的化学方程式；",
      "role": "subquestion",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          264,
          1150,
          322
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "MAIN_CONTENT",
        "relation": "main",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "（2）若完全反应后生成氧气"
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "latex": "9.6\\,\\mathrm{g}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "，求参加反应的氯酸钾的质量；"
        }
      ],
      "role": "subquestion",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          322,
          1150,
          380
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "MAIN_CONTENT",
        "relation": "main",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "（3）若原混合物共"
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "latex": "30.0\\,\\mathrm{g}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "，求反应后剩余固体中二氧化锰的质量分数（结果精确到0.1%）。"
        }
      ],
      "role": "subquestion",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          380,
          1150,
          482
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "MAIN_CONTENT",
        "relation": "main",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ans1",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "【答案】（1）"
        },
        {
          "type": "chemistry",
          "latex": "2\\mathrm{KClO_3}\\xrightarrow[\\Delta]{\\mathrm{MnO_2}}2\\mathrm{KCl}+3\\mathrm{O_2}\\uparrow"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "；（2）"
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "latex": "24.5\\,\\mathrm{g}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "；（3）27.0%。"
        }
      ],
      "role": "answer",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          482,
          1150,
          547
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "SUPPORTING_CONTENT",
        "relation": "supporting",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ans2",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "【解析】（3）"
        },
        {
          "type": "chemistry",
          "latex": "\\mathrm{MnO_2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "的质量为"
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "latex": "30.0-24.5=5.5\\,\\mathrm{g}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "，剩余固体为"
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "latex": "30.0-9.6=20.4\\,\\mathrm{g}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ],
      "role": "analysis",
      "source": {
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          90,
          547,
          1150,
          605
        ]
      },
      "selection": {
        "category": "SUPPORTING_CONTENT",
        "relation": "supporting",
        "certainty": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hw",
      "text": "对了!",
